{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>For his sons after him.</b> For the one who comes into the high priesthood after him." "<b>To be anointed in them.</b> To be invested with greatness through them — for there is an anointing that is a term of dominion, as in ״לְךָ נְתַתִּים לְמָשְׁחָה״ (Numbers 18), ״אַל תִּגְּעוּ בִּמְשִׁיחָי״ (I Chronicles 16)." "<b>And to fill their hand with them.</b> Through the garments he is invested with the high priesthood."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:36.405076612Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}